 unbearable sadness that accompanies much of what they do , though there 's no denying that even in the perkiest of moments , the band is sweet on that sadness and never thinks of it as a cur ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d01", "start": 512, "end": 530, "text": "They never want to"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 0, "end": 21, "text": ", James Christopher ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 22, "end": 51, "text": "`` Blitzen Trapper : VII '' ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 52, "end": 62, "text": "AllMusic ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 63, "end": 87, "text": "Retrieved 23 July 2015 ."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 88, "end": 106, "text": "^ Moeller , Sean ."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 107, "end": 170, "text": "`` Men And Women On The Road To Nowhere Are Still Destined '' ."}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 171, "end": 183, "text": "Daytrotter ."}, "D3S8": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 184, "end": 208, "text": "Retrieved 23 July 2015 ."}, "D3S9": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d02", "start": 209, "end": 550, "text": "v t e Blitzen Trapper Eric Earley Brian Adrian Koch Nathan Vanderpool Michael Elson Erik Menteer Michael Van Pelt Marty Marquis Drew Laughery Studio albums Blitzen Trapper Field Rexx Wild Mountain Nation Furr Destroyer of the Void American Goldwing VII All Across This Land Live albums Live in Portland Live Harvest Live at Third Man Records"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef:d03", "start": 0, "end": 21, "text": "kind of make sens